---

This project bundles tooling around third-party software that remains under
its own license:

  cc-connect  - MIT, https://github.com/chenhg5/cc-connect
  OpenCode    - https://github.com/sst/opencode
  Handy       - speech-to-text runtime, https://github.com/handy-computer
  GigaAM      - speech recognition model, Sber AI

Speech recognition and synthesis run locally. No audio or text is transmitted
anywhere by this repository's own code.